   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The plural without subject",
   "texto": [
    "In the impersonal of unspecified agent, the third plural person is used in present or future, or the plural in past, without naming who acts: **Его уважают**, **Меня пригласили**, **Нас предупредят**. The person concerned is usually in charge.",
    "It is not the passive with participle or the form with **-ся**: the verb retains an active plural form, but the agent remains unidentified. If named, it appears as subject: **Меня пригласил директор**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Passive or not?",
   "texto": [
    "If you mean who did it, use the active form: **Меня пригласил директор** (I was invited by the director). If it doesn't matter, use the plural: **Меня пригласили**. With verbs of communication is very common: **Меня спросили** (asked me)."
